{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["The reason for <b>\"Two nations are in your womb\"</b> — He informed her so that she would not be alarmed, for the fact that she was pregnant with twins is the cause of this crushing within her womb, for such is the way of women. And it is possible further that He said this: because they are two nations that hate each other and fight one another, even at the beginning of their formation they made strife — an allusion to what would ultimately be between them. And now they will rest, and she will find rest and tranquility for her soul."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:34:43.758464947Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}